        </p>

        <div class="bg-[#F0F1F4] rounded-[10px] p-[24px] max-[640px]:p-[20px] max-w-[480px]">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[#CC3333] mb-[16px]">AI视频</p>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-start gap-[12px]">
            <span class="text-[13px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-normal leading-[1.4]">短视频（15秒内）</span>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.4] shrink-0">¥2,050起</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[13px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal leading-[1.6] mt-[12px]">
            创意、生成、后期，全包。
          </p>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>

    <!-- Advertising -->
    <section class="mt-[96px] max-[640px]:mt-[64px]">
      <Container>
        <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-[12px] p-[48px] max-[640px]:p-[20px]">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[#CC3333] mb-[8px]">广告投放</p>
          <h2 class="text-[28px] max-[640px]:text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.25] text-[#FFFFFF] mb-[8px]">中国平台媒介采买</h2>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] font-normal leading-[1.6] mb-[32px] max-w-[680px]">
            媒介预算单独走账，全程透明，直付平台方。最低签3个月，开户费¥10,250。
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:grid-cols-1 gap-[16px]">
            <div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] border-[0.5px] border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] rounded-[10px] p-[24px]">
              <p class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] font-normal mb-[8px]">月预算低于¥102,500</p>
              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">¥10,250<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] font-normal">/月</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] font-normal leading-[2]">
                <p>全链路投放策略</p>
                <p>广告组、广告数量不限</p>
                <p>顾问答疑不设次数</p>
                <p>定制数据报表</p>
                <p>创意方向把关</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#CC3333] rounded-[12px] p-[24px]">
              <p class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.7)] font-normal mb-[8px]">月预算超过¥102,500</p>
              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">6–10%<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.7)] font-normal"> 预算占比</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] font-normal leading-[2]">
                <p>基础方案全含，另加：</p>
                <p>每周视频复盘</p>
                <p>效果归因分析</p>
                <p>精准人群定向</p>
                <p>费率阶梯下调</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.4)] font-normal mt-[24px]">
            覆盖平台：微信、抖音、小红书、微博、百度SEM/PPC、B站、快手。
          </p>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>

    <!-- Influencer, Training, Consulting, CRM -->
    <section class="mt-[96px] max-[640px]:mt-[64px]">
      <Container>
        <SectionBar />
        <h2 class="text-[28px] max-[640px]:text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.25] text-[#1A1A1A] mb-[32px]">更多可加服务</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:grid-cols-1 gap-[16px]">
          <!-- Influencer -->
          <div class="bg-[#F0F1F4] rounded-[10px] p-[24px] max-[640px]:p-[20px]">
            <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[#CC3333] mb-[8px]">达人营销</p>
            <h3 class="text-[18px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.3] mb-[8px]">KOL、KOC项目</h3>
            <p class="text-[28px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[8px]">15–25%<span class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal"> 达人预算占比</span></p>
            <div class="text-[13px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal leading-[1.8]">
              <p>选号、资质审核、议价、brief撰写、全程对接、效果复盘。</p>
              <p class="mt-[8px]">预算¥341,500以上收15%，常规收20%，¥68,300以内的小项目收25%。</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Training -->
          <div class="bg-[#E8E0D8] rounded-[10px] p-[24px] max-[640px]:p-[20px]">
            <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[#CC3333] mb-[8px]">培训</p>
