            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Consulting -->
          <div class="bg-[#F0F1F4] rounded-[10px] p-[24px] max-[640px]:p-[20px]">
            <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[#CC3333] mb-[8px]">咨询</p>
            <h3 class="text-[18px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.3] mb-[8px]">按需咨询</h3>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal leading-[1.6] mb-[16px]">按项目范围、周期单独报价。</p>
