    <!-- Notes -->
    <section class="mt-[96px] max-[640px]:mt-[64px] mb-[96px] max-[640px]:mb-[64px]">
      <Container>
        <div class="max-w-[680px]">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.3] mb-[16px]">几条须知</h3>
          <div class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal leading-[1.8]">
            <p>所有报价均为人民币、税前。具体税率按开票主体（上海或香港）的当地规定。汇率按1美元=6.83人民币换算。</p>
            <p>月度预付。</p>
            <p>上线节奏：签约后两周内开通账号、发出首批内容。</p>
            <p>可加平台按列表价叠加到任意方案。</p>
            <p>超出标准范围的需求，单独谈定制方案。<a href="/zh/contact" class="text-[#CC3333] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#B02D2D]">预约通话</a>。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
